\begin{tikzpicture}[x=10mm,y=10mm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black}]
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(4,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[->,black] (0,0)--(0,3) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[->,black,thick] (1,2.4)--(1,0.7);
\path (1,2.4) node[above] {$t=4$};
\draw[->,black,thick] (2,1.8)--(3.5,1.8);
\path (2.7,1.8) node[above] {$t=5$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
The arrows show velocity directions only; their locations and lengths are schematic.
